Feature: Attorney Invitation and Management
  As a donor
  I want to invite the primary attorneys named on my LPA and control their access to my financial data
  So that the people I have authorised — and only those people — can oversee my finances on my behalf

  Background:
    Given a donor has a confirmed LPA naming their primary attorneys

